### Browser Compatibility

This software is designed to work with modern web browsers. Supported browsers include:
- Chrome 88+
- Firefox 85+
- Safari 14+
- Edge 88+

Legacy browser support may require additional polyfills and is not guaranteed.

### Accessibility Compliance

This software aims to comply with WCAG 2.1 Level AA accessibility standards. For accessibility support or to report accessibility issues, please contact our accessibility team.

### Progressive Web App (PWA)

This application includes Progressive Web App features that may cache data locally on user devices. Users should be aware of local storage implications and data privacy considerations.

